# Databases the own-server helper (deploy-to-endpoint) manages on YOUR SQL Server.
# Format:  TYPE|NAME|TOKEN|PACKAGE
#   TYPE    = bootstrap (created directly) | product (deployed by SchemaQuench)
#   NAME    = database name. Rename here to avoid colliding with a real database
#             of the same name on your server; the helper drops/creates this name.
#   TOKEN   = (product rows) the DB-name script token overridden into SchemaQuench.
#   PACKAGE = (product rows) the package folder under Demos/SqlServer/.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
bootstrap|TestMain||
bootstrap|TestSecondary||
product|AdventureWorks|AdventureWorksDb|AdventureWorks
product|Northwind|NorthwindDb|Northwind
product|Sakila|SakilaDb|Sakila
product|Chinook|ChinookDb|Chinook
product|TenantCRM|TenantCRMDb|TenantCRM
